<link xlink:href="&url.php.manual.install.windows.building;">building on Windows</link>
section.</entity>

<entity name="pecl.windows.download.avail">Windows binaries (<acronym>DLL</acronym> files)
for this <acronym>PECL</acronym> extension are available from the PECL website.</entity>

<entity name="pecl.moved-ver">This extension has been moved to the &link.pecl;
repository and is no longer bundled with PHP as of PHP </entity>

<entity name="pecl.moving.to.pie"><warning>
 <simpara>
  PECL is deprecated.
  PHP Installer for Extensions (<acronym>PIE</acronym>) replaces PECL and is recommended to install extensions.
  Find out more at <link xlink:href="https://github.com/php/pie">https://github.com/php/pie</link>
 </simpara>
</warning></entity>

<!-- Common pieces for reference part END -->

